  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical and strategic communication assistance for an inclusive Social, Energy and Digital transition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This action aims to strengthen Cabo Verde&apos;s capacity to implement inclusive policies and reforms in support of social protection, energy transition, and accessible digital transformation while building public awareness and support for EU-funded initiatives. As a Small Island Developing State (SIDS), Cabo Verde faces structural limitations in managing specialized technical areas due to its small administration spread across nine islands. The action addresses three key challenges: i) implementation capacity gaps in technical areas essential for green transition, 2) communication and awareness gaps regarding EU-supported programmes, and 3) limited economic diversification that creates vulnerability to external shocks.</narrative>
  </description>
